  "title": "Discover machine learning enhancements in Create ML",
  "description": "Find out how Create ML can help you do even more with machine learning models. Learn about the latest updates to image understanding and text-based tasks with multilingual BERT embeddings. Discover how easy it is to train models that can understand the content of images using multi-label classification. We’ll also share information about interactive model evaluation and the latest APIs for custom training data augmentations. To learn more about the latest updates to machine learning, watch “Explore Natural Language multilingual models” and “Improve Core ML integration with async prediction\" from WWDC23.",
